      "notes": "The phone, tablet and Mac app. It asks for these by name as each of its features is first used, and a customer approves them from its own link. Two of them reveal a secret to an administrator who already holds the role for it: DeviceLocalCredential.Read.All (a Windows LAPS password) and BitLockerKey.Read.All (a recovery key).",
